"两项独立启用。应用前需退出游戏；不替换原始剧本或数据库，必须通过本启动器启动。译文修订完成后需重新应用。" = "Both are enabled separately. Quit the game before applying; the original scripts and database are not replaced, and the game must be launched through this launcher. Re-apply after revising the translation.";
"两项独立启用。应用前需退出游戏；会备份原始页面，仅添加辅助加载入口，不替换 main.js。译文修订完成后也需重新应用。" = "Both are enabled separately. Quit the game before applying; the original page is backed up and only an Assist load entry is added, without replacing main.js. Re-apply after revising the translation.";
"两项独立启用。应用前需退出游戏；会备份原始页面，仅添加辅助加载入口。当前接入 NW.js 目录，不支持直接运行 Electron／ASAR 原包。译文修订完成后需重新应用。" = "Both are enabled separately. Quit the game before applying; the original page is backed up and only an Assist load entry is added. This currently works with NW.js folders and does not support running Electron/ASAR packages directly. Re-apply after revising the translation.";
"两项独立启用。应用前需退出游戏；添加独立辅助剧本，不替换原始剧本或数据库。译文修订完成后需重新应用。" = "Both are enabled separately. Quit the game before applying; a separate Assist script is added without replacing the original scripts or database. Re-apply after revising the translation.";
