"启用后启动游戏，点击右上角「游戏辅助」或按 ⇧F8。支持游戏变量 f、系统变量 sf 的搜索、修改、锁定及数值逐次筛选；不提供 RPG 专用的角色和战斗操作。" = "Enable it, then launch the game and click Assist in the top-right corner or press ⇧F8. Supports searching, editing, and locking game variables (f) and system variables (sf), plus step-by-step value filtering; RPG-specific character and battle operations are not provided.";
"启用后启动游戏，在游戏右上角点击「游戏辅助」或按 ⇧F8。进入游戏或读档后可操作，不需要启动器保持开启。\n• 物品、防具、武器按数据库自动分栏，显示描述与数量；行首方框勾上即锁定，可 ±1／±100 步进和整栏批量设置\n• 变量／开关搜索、编辑与持续锁定\n• 角色属性、装备槽更换与全队恢复\n• 已知／未知数值查找，按增加、减少、改变和未改变逐次筛选\n• 对象浏览：按 $ 开头的属性路径查看对象，并写入标量字段\n• 游戏／移动速度、随机遇敌控制、穿墙\n• 地图搜索与坐标传送、地图事件和公共事件查看及执行" = "Enable it, then launch the game and click Assist in the game's top-right corner or press ⇧F8. It works after entering the game or loading a save, and the launcher does not need to stay open.\n• Items, armor, and weapons are tabbed straight from the database with descriptions and counts; ticking the box on the left locks an entry, and ±1/±100 steps plus whole-tab bulk setting are available\n• Variable/switch search, editing, and persistent locking\n• Character stats, equipment slot swapping, and party recovery\n• Known/unknown value search, narrowed step by step by increased, decreased, changed, and unchanged\n• Object browser: inspect an object through a $ path and write scalar fields\n• Game/movement speed, random encounter control, walk through walls\n• Map search and coordinate teleport, map and common event viewing and execution";
